acb-b6ea-e2b2667f4ade block--slider--block-content--6e2cb6b6-f15b-4acb-b6ea-e2b2667f4ade--5806 block--9567bbc1-29b3-48ee-8cc7-1d4966aee329 block--9567bbc1-29b3-48ee-8cc7-1d4966aee329--5806 block block-block-content block-block-content6e2cb6b6-f15b-4acb-b6ea-e2b2667f4ade\">\n  \n    \n      \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-nir-lp-block-node field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">  \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-nir-lp-block-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><h3>Our Company</h3>\n\n<p>Vera Therapeutics is a clinical-stage biotechnology company focused on developing treatments for serious immunological diseases. Vera\u2019s mission is to advance treatments that target the source of immunologic diseases in order to change the standard of care for patients. Vera\u2019s lead product candidate is atacicept, a fusion protein self-administered as a subcutaneous injection once weekly that blocks both B-cell activating factor (BAFF)&nbsp;and A proliferation-inducing ligand (APRIL), which stimulate B cells and plasma cells to produce autoantibodies contributing to certain autoimmune diseases, including IgA nephropathy (IgAN), also known as Berger\u2019s disease. Vera is also developing MAU868, a monoclonal antibody that neutralizes infection with BK Virus, a polyomavirus that can have devastating consequences in certain settings such as kidney transplant.</p>\n</div>\n      \n</div>\n      \n  </div>\n</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-12 col-md-4 radix-layouts-slidergutter panel-panel\">\n        <div  class=\"panel-panel-inner\">\n          <div class=\"block-region-slidergutter\"><div data-storage-id=\"node:5806:full:20786\" data-uuid=\"ef6147b4-5c48-4bb5-a249-efadc198f426\" class=\"block--market-data-block__stock-quote block--market-data-block__stock-quote--5806 block--slidergutter--market-data-block__stock-quote block--slidergutter--market-data-block__stock-qu